{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/9vdVPmUBTACGhW9th5BnpQ","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:50.108322+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/9vdVPmUBTACGhW9th5BnpQ","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/smI9soavFdq392PW1Q21hBbKmLhfl6aZejgWk8oE9yKRVkWqE2NfDw6SmAkEyLXsWtiaVNfOsibDfJvibN2QOao6iaz11MUYMlELjzg4KfFJpRo/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/smI9soavFdpKIxMxaSIicSYzkcVffphibC7cbRBw1NESolsnia9H4koxEgxFJYArQEtXaEuslluF3p3qcyhr8nIYwY6xWiboNXEnmw1PtfwuKBc/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>为让更多优秀考生更深入地了解我单位特色与优势，各学科实力、师资力量、研究生教育情况和研究生招生信息等，我单位将于2026年7月10日-11日期间举办校园开放日活动。活动期间，我单位将进行研究生招生政策宣讲、与导师面对面交流互动等活动，提供详尽的报考信息和指导。欢迎有意向报考我单位研究生的同学前来参加，现将有关事项通知如下。</span></strong></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/smI9soavFdrgbjqBypfmss1D3U2fxJFr0lc9XibQSnjvEeh3U7EmXWE4MPBTKPDrNzdHwFaIP58S4HibMZdXvpoQvkicqJOLQBQoHvytNCHWuM/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>点击下方图片查看原文</span></p></section><section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzIzNjAxMDU1MA==&amp;mid=2247638639&amp;idx=2&amp;sn=bd71d817cea1a3acc499cb0c25df753e&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/smI9soavFdotYu96hHg9OATms4Dib3bq7vpBhNlcrE8a15H6auiaWP9z5N2YgYicv7mcoKcBNOicybUrR5KHbib1zH7hJKC4ziaxU2baRcz9Sl1wg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></a></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>1</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>活动规模及活动对象</span></strong></p></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/smI9soavFdribXicQoJdrpj7ESrmKBQOHcWxFJzWttXOJrmyA7QwctxBZPlpVyFVcOqDsAicnvr9jNLdp7pxQJ29sASAR8mTfRM23hGhC3aMwg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>本次活动规模拟定</span><strong><span>150名</span></strong><span>左右，具体专业详见报名系统，报名条件如下：</span></p><p><span>1.具有良好的思想品德和政治素质，遵纪守法，身心健康。</span></p><p><span>2.高水平大学或设有特色专业全日制高校的本科三年级在校生（2027届毕业生）。</span></p><p><span>3.有意来河海大学求学深造，对所报专业有浓厚的兴趣，愿意从事相关学术研究或实践工作。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>2</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名时间及方式</span></strong></p></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/smI9soavFdrMlxfibrUwUILETN7hTr5iamPEOk2uD6oiaJh7t40zFicPjtZBAQAia7GXNrsdwicpRyEKgrY9o2KmAXP63eo1uyF4sVvSz7lgl8JDY/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>请有意向申请我单位校园开放日的同学于北京时间 </span><strong><span>2026年6月16日10:00—2026年7月3日12:00</span></strong><span>，在河海大学研究生招生管理系统（考生端）（https://yzss.hhu.edu.cn/）中，招生项目选择“全国优秀大学生校园开放日”进行注册、登录和信息填报（具体操作详见系统提示），不在规定时间内填报的所有报名信息均无效。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>3</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>材料提交与确认</span></strong></p></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/smI9soavFdqbTCBbdh7cPT4d4Gz0hia0rZBP1TkW1IzaCrFKyhDX6lSKb7ia7GB8QnDJjRdKhdTIWlDdA25h6p2mAsBOiabw0iausqibfNkA1Ilo/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>1.参加我单位校园开放日的同学，需提供以下材料</span><strong><span>（请按照顺序扫描并汇总成一个 PDF 文件，命名方式：申请专业_申请人姓名_开放日申请材料.PDF，上传至报名系统）</span></strong><span>, 并携带材料纸质版报到。</span></p><p><span>（1）“2026年全国优秀大学生校园开放日报名登记表”1份（请至报名系统生成和下载）。</span></p><p><span>（2）身份证、学生证复印件。</span></p><p><span>（3）前两年半成绩单与总评成绩、排名证明1份。</span></p><p><span>（4）学术或科研成果、各类获奖证书扫描件各1份。</span></p><p><span>（5）国家英语四、六级考试成绩，或IELTS/TOEFL成绩，或GRE/GMAT成绩等体现自身外语水平的证明材料1份。</span></p><p><span>2.我单位将对提交的报名信息进行审核后确定入围开放日活动对象。请提交报名申请的同学于北京时间</span><strong><span>7月6日12时前登录报名系统查询审核状态</span></strong><span>，入围者请于北京时间</span><strong><span>7月6日17时前，在报名系统中点击确认参加</span></strong><span>，逾期未确认参加者视作放弃。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>4</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>活动方式及具体安排</span></strong></p></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/smI9soavFdqBkt8oibnjsmWTs15sIhQUianXJ3GmaF1XkvGgZRVJ4wNAxqP7WWrFPaHYBdibz9dcnKlf7WGLVnNrSXiaxlVfXcdibWs7IV2IR8FA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><strong><span>活动时间</span></strong></span></p><p><span>2025年7月10日-11日</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><strong><span>报到时间</span></strong></span></p><p><span>2025年7月10日 13:00-14:00</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><strong><span>报到地点</span></strong></span></p><p><span>河海大学西康路校区水文楼二楼大厅（校内学生）；</span></p><p><span>隽恒酒店大厅（校外学生）</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><strong><span>活动形式</span></strong></span></p><p><span>现场参加，不收取任何费用</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><strong><span>活动内容</span></strong></span></p><p><span>开营仪式</span></p><p><span>专业介绍及学长学姐面对面</span></p><p><span>教授名师面对面</span></p><p><span>……</span></p><p><span>具体详细日程安排另行通知。</span></p><p><span>学院师资队伍信息请查看学院网站</span></p><p><span>https://shxy.hhu.edu.cn/26412/list.htm</span></p><p><span>也可至微信公众号</span><strong><span>【河海水文】</span></strong><span>搜索</span><strong><span>“研招动态”</span></strong><span>，</span></p><p><span>查看导师团队（部分）信息。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>5</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span> 其 他</span></strong></p></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/smI9soavFdorqAj7SibT7GVl3XxXkdkdlwqPmXkpJ0p3w1HAN205Lia0Q0wQ7VBwN1OntMXeM09gNjlFR8HJIBLiazY6lwhgyfx06fibHGmM2Mo/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>1.其他未尽事宜请参见单位官网通知，最终招生单位、专业、方向和导师以2027年博士、硕士研究生招生简章和专业目录公布信息为准。</span></strong></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span>2.开放日待遇：</span></strong></p><p><span>（1）差旅、食宿：</span></p><p><span>提供校园开放日期间在南京的食宿（本校和南京本地学生住宿交通自理），后续推免或者一志愿被我院录取的外校应届考生，给予一定的往返交通补贴。</span></p><p><span>（2）保险：我院将为参加校园开放日的同学购买开放日期间人身意外伤害保险。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span>3.联系方式：</span></strong></p><p><span>联系人：许老师</span></p><p><span>联系电话：025-83786614</span></p><p><span>电子邮箱：94674406@qq.com</span></p><p><span>通信地址：江苏省南京市鼓楼区西康路 1 号河海大学水文院</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"c4b95b685cb8996ce1b9dd1c60d2001c070206b8f853ad497d613d131f6b60c1","textLength":1371,"sourceSha256":"161e050ccd4558f5febf47a75badf77c613ac23b8e3076bc4b31e51b42f78e96","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-c89bead76402e14bb448","title":"2026年河海大学水文水资源学院2026年全国优秀大学生校园开放日及有关安排的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:50.108322+00:00"}
